note: An "otherwise" after "when"s for every variant can never run: a warning, and the program still runs.
a shape is one of:
    a circle with a radius (a number).
    a point.

let s be a new point.
check which kind s is:
    when it's a circle:
        say "circle".
    when it's a point:
        say "point".
    otherwise:
        say "never".
